#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.md:1
msgid "H2 Resource Estimation"
msgstr "H2 资源估计"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial estimates EFTQC hardware resources for H2 with `q2m3.core.resource_estimation`. It "
"compares vacuum and MM-embedded Hamiltonians."
msgstr "本教程使用 `q2m3.core.resource_estimation` 估计 H2 的 EFTQC 硬件资源，比较真空和 MM 嵌入哈密顿量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.md:6
msgid "Run The Script"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.md:12
msgid "Minimal API Pattern"
msgstr "最小 API 用法"

