msgstr "维护中的示例报告："

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.md
msgid "Metric"
msgstr "指标"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.md
msgid "H2/STO-3G reference"
msgstr "H2/STO-3G 参考值"

